bind Submit Benefit Request: Request ID, Employee ID, Benefit Type, Benefit Amount
bind Review Benefit Request: Request ID, Employee ID
bind Approve Request: Request ID, Request Status
bind Reject Request: Request ID, Request Status
bind Process Payment: Request ID, Benefit Amount, Employee ID
bind Update Employee Record: Request ID, Employee ID, Benefit Type
bind Notify Employee: Request ID, Employee ID, Request Status
bind Audit Benefit Process: Audit ID, Request ID
bind Submit Appeal: Appeal ID, Request ID, Employee ID
bind Review Appeal: Appeal ID, Request ID
bind Approve Appeal: Appeal ID, Request Status
bind Reject Appeal: Appeal ID, Request Status
bind Notify Appeal Decision: Appeal ID, Employee ID, Request Status
bind Conduct Benefit Orientation: Employee ID, Orientation Type
bind Evaluate Benefit Utilization: Utilization Rate
Request ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Employee ID: integer between 1 and 50000
Request Status: Approved, Rejected
Benefit Amount: float between 100.0 and 10000.0
Benefit Type: Health Insurance, Retirement Plan, Paid Leave, Education Assistance
Appeal ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Audit ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Utilization Rate: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Orientation Type: New Employee, Open Enrollment
